From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: domicile CI <ci@domicile.invalid>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: the shell has the desk's notifications

A DomicileNotificationsEvent carries the desk's notifications -- each a
DomicileNotification with its DomicileNotificationActions --
dismissNotifications() takes ids back to the compositor, and
invokeNotificationAction() an id and a key.

The interfaces are new files under src/; what cannot be a new file is a
name in a generated-bindings list.
---
 .../blink/renderer/bindings/generated_in_modules.gni      | 8 ++++++++
 third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/idl_in_modules.gni    | 4 ++++
 2 files changed, 12 insertions(+)

